Part C (REFRAMED): false-positive overlap rate under content ablation
crisismmd/fakeddit have ZERO true overlap (verified from source) -- there is nothing to
correctly detect, so this measures how often each content condition WRONGLY claims a
node overlaps at the standard threshold 0.2. Lower is better; 0.000 = never wrong.
==============================================================================

crisismmd: false-positive overlap rate @ threshold 0.2, mean over 3 seeds
  nfmcd_default             0.0333 +- 0.0244  (n=3)
  nfmcd_structure_only      0.1459 +- 0.0398  (n=3)
  nfmcd_text_only           0.3975 +- 0.2051  (n=3)
  nfmcd_image_only          0.5391 +- 0.0065  (n=3)

